93
00:05:09,613 --> 00:05:10,853
There's no hope anymore.

94
00:05:11,353 --> 00:05:13,153
A person can't live without hope.

95
00:05:13,553 --> 00:05:15,133
They get stuck, they go mad.

96
00:05:15,692 --> 00:05:21,593
