115
00:06:20,290 --> 00:06:21,350
It's a way of life.

116
00:06:21,629 --> 00:06:22,389
Traffic jams.

117
00:06:23,170 --> 00:06:25,170
Because we didn't have traffic
jams before, if you remember.

118
00:06:25,189 --> 00:06:26,029
Yes, yes, yes, yes.

119
00:06:26,389 --> 00:06:33,490
These are, yes, as Konrad Lorenz
would say, the sins, the three

120
00:06:33,529 --> 00:06:37,409
