sins of civilized mankind.

121
00:06:37,910 --> 00:06:39,850
These are the sins of civilized mankind.

122
00:06:40,269 --> 00:06:46,909
Because that's what the open society
really is, a society in full evolution.

123
00:06:47,110 --> 00:06:54,710
But, you see, back then we had no point
