and you don't have it anymore.

132
00:07:29,620 --> 00:07:30,841
And then you feel frustrated.

133
00:07:30,882 --> 00:07:32,262
What did we have back then that we lost?

134
00:07:32,300 --> 00:07:35,360
Well, back then we didn't have it yet.

135
00:07:35,401 --> 00:07:39,620
Since then we've had those things,
and now the frustration sets in.

136
00:07:39,882 --> 00:07:40,201
OK.

137
00:07:41,620 --> 00:07:46,021
I recognize this mechanism, so
it probably means that, a bit

138
00:07:46,101 --> 00:07:52,161
later than Westerners, we too are
longing for times that

139
00:07:52,442 --> 00:07:54,180
