201
00:11:06,169 --> 00:11:12,370
A neglected greenhouse gets invaded by—
By weeds. ...by weeds, by pests—

202
00:11:12,850 --> 00:11:15,550
Because we live— By enemies. ...we
live with this illusion that Romania has

